PROS;
excellent graphics, driving sequences are challenging and fun (for awhile)
CONS;
HTH combat is clumsy (esp on PC) some combo moves require several awkward keystrokes at once-making them difficult to accomplish
The story is very shallow and morally ambiguous at best-which makes it difficult to relate to the protaganist.
questing Very repetitive without much purpose-collecting mats/vehicles/mobs etc etc-mostly just one big farming run.
IMO;
wait until this product is at least 1/2 off sale, definitely not worth the $50-or whatever "sale" price Steam is offering.
There are 1000's of videos on YouTube-it's probably more entertaining to watch this game then play it.

